WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,310
Didn’t you say your surname was Liu?

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,270
Dr. Liu, I know I was wrong

3
00:00:03,270 --> 00:00:04,340
Never pretend to be your style again

4
00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:12,410
She's the patient here, mentally ill

5
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:18,780
a mental illness

6
00:00:18,780 --> 00:00:20,580
In a world full of loss, five children are cherished

7
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:21,780
Lived for a whole year

8
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:26,930
I don’t know how she did it. She has to be taken away.

9
